CodeSystem: FijiYasanaCS
Id: fiji-yasana
Title: "Fiji Yasana CodeSystem"
Description: """
A code system representing Yasana (province) largest administrative division codes in Fiji iTaukei society as recognised in Fiji,

Codes and display names should be sourced from the
authoritative Fiji geographic administrative dataset
adopted by the Fiji Implementation Guide.
"""
* ^url = $yasana-cs
* ^status = #active
* ^experimental = false
* ^caseSensitive = true
